# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RISE environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit `.env` — it is gitignored.
# Every variable below is OPTIONAL. With none of them set, the app runs fully:
# the AI description generator simply reports "not configured yet" and the
# manual posting form works end to end.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Optional: AI internship-description generator -------------------------
# Any OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint works. These are read only
# on the server, inside the generateJd server function, so the key is never
# exposed to the browser.
#
#   AI_API_KEY   Bearer token for the endpoint
#   AI_BASE_URL  Base URL INCLUDING /v1, no trailing slash
#   AI_MODEL     Provider-specific model id

# --- Example A: Google Gemini (OpenAI-compatible endpoint) ---
# AI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key
# AI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
# AI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# --- Example B: OpenAI ---
# AI_API_KEY=sk-...
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# --- Example C: OpenRouter ---
# AI_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# AI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# AI_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001

# --- Example D: self-hosted, fully offline ---
# AI_API_KEY=not-used-but-required
# AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
# AI_MODEL=qwen2.5-instruct

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Planned (not yet read by the code) — see docs/VERIFICATION.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ABC_API_BASE / ABC_API_KEY   Academic Bank of Credits verification
# AISHE_API_BASE / AISHE_API_KEY  Institution (AISHE code) verification
# GSTIN_API_BASE / GSTIN_API_KEY  Organization (GSTIN) verification
